you have a power of community.

00:31:54.260 --> 00:31:56.930
We have over a couple
thousand people there.

00:31:56.930 --> 00:31:58.930
Maybe not at the same
time, but at least there

00:31:58.930 --> 00:32:01.530
is a place where you
can browse some history,

00:32:01.530 --> 00:32:03.435
find some answers,
ask questions,

00:32:03.435 --> 00:32:04.310
